074674   %            T O P O F F
074674   %
074674   % SUBROUTINE TO CALL A ROUTINE IN PAGING-OFF AREA FROM THE PIT3 SEGMENT
074674   %
074674   % THIS ROUTINE MUST BE CALLED IN IOF OR WITH MONITOR LEVEL DISABLED
074674   % WHEN CALLED ON LEVEL 1.
074674   %
074674   SUBR TOPOFF
074674   INTEGER POINTER LREG,CROUTINE
074676   TOPOFF: X:=:L+1=:"LREG"-1; X:=X.S0=:"CROUTINE":=L; *POF
074706           CALL CROUTINE; GO NSKIP; MIN "LREG"
074711   NSKIP:  *PON
074712           GO LREG
